{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YQwn42wOxt1795017149.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「香港冬日小鎮」即日起展開，今年首度擴展至中環、尖沙咀及銅鑼灣三個地點。</p><p></p><p>在中環皇后像廣場花園，高22米的聖誕樹傍晚起亮燈，閃閃發光。包括終審法院在內附近九座標誌性建築的外牆，每晚7時至11時都有定時投映。廣場花園就化身成歐陸風格火車站，內有小木屋，還有市集。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WINTERFEST-2300 -1_CLEAN_20261118_233220_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tjsfQQjIri1795017177.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-18-23h59m27s254.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026s6FVzMg76l1795017701.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>吸引不少市民及旅客前來。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WINTERFEST-2300 -1_CLEAN_20261118_233220_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269RdgNh5yim1795017439.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-18-23h59m00s746.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265lQtGBX1Xg1795017723.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>海南旅客李小姐說：「燈光很好看，然後還有聖誕樹，然後還有投在這個樓上面的那個投影，很漂亮。氛圍很好，就像一個聖誕小鎮的感覺。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-18-23h59m42s131.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aAPe7hkdWz1795017744.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>加拿大旅客Justin說：「很好，這裡的氛圍比加拿大更好，所有燈光和氣氛太好了，這裡效果令人難以置信。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-18-23h59m22s133.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026J9KY1sSJcW1795017770.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>李先生說：「變美了很多，比去年還有更多東西，我應該會再去尖沙咀那個。」</p><p></p><p>如果中環冬日小鎮太多人，亦可考慮到銅鑼灣的冬日小鎮，那裡將會打造成精靈村莊，同樣在大廈外牆有光影表演，下周三正式開放。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-19-00h00m13s962.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026slHqcHlURh1795017808.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>至於首度舉辨「冬日小鎮」的尖沙咀。聖誕鹿、松鼠等光影圖案亦現身香港文化中心。太空館變成聖誕水晶球三個地點的活動，明年1月5日結束。公眾可以免費入場。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-19-00h00m29s864.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mQ2LSZhycE1795017826.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-19-00h00m37s685.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263ZXlRfColh1795017842.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T17:04:27.898393+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":431,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T15:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:25.116324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:57:41.589386+00:00","content_hash":"0e6d3f26a677ab76b51240d92243c1b4fff84ae78b6b2ad47c2f78172e80deac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T17:04:27.898393+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}